# Responsive layout

Mobile-first. Base styles are 375px. Layer `md:` / `lg:` / `xl:` for page structure. Use Tailwind v4 container queries (`@container` + `@md:`) when a component reflows to its slot, not the viewport.

## Do

- `site-shell` for horizontal rhythm (already capped at 1440 + fluid padding).
- `min-w-0` on flex children. `min-h-svh` not `h-screen`. `svh`/`dvh` for full-height scenes.
- Headings: `clamp(min, vw, max)` with max ≤ ~2.5× min. Body: fixed `rem`, ≥ 16px.
- Cap reading measure ~65–75ch. Touch targets ≥ 44px. `env(safe-area-inset-*)` on full-bleed chrome.
- `gsap.matchMedia()`: below `md`, drop pins / WebGL, reduce parallax speed. Honour `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Viewport: `device-width`, `initialScale: 1`, `viewportFit: "cover"`. Never `userScalable: false`.

## Do not

- Scale a 1440px absolute artboard with `transform` as “responsive” — text and tap targets collapse.
- SaaS sidebar+topbar shells, `h-screen` clipping, desktop-first `lg:` then fighting back down.
- `overflow-x-hidden` on `body` (Lenis). Prefer `overflow-x: clip` on `html`.
- Framer Motion for scroll. `@tailwindcss/container-queries` plugin (built into v4).
